---
<Layout
  title={pageTitle}
  description="A clear, practical roadmap to navigate polytechnic diplomas, lateral entry to engineering, and skilled careers - and figure out which path actually fits how you learn, build, and earn."
  isArticle={true}
  showPrintCover={false}
  printCoverTitle=""
